@prefix wikibase: <http://wikiba.se/ontology#>.

_:Bb032905ea550bee8d1f7a4fa01a8f5a2 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#members> (wikibase:Form
                                                                             wikibase:Item
                                                                             wikibase:Lexeme
